      "worked": "In each second, David covers 4 m and Renae covers 6 m towards one another.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Gap closed in 1 second}&=4+6\\\\\\text{Gap closed in 1 second}&=10\\text{ m}\\\\\\text{Time taken}&=120\\div10\\\\\\text{Time taken}&=12\\text{ s}\\end{align*}$$",
